  "scope": "Real native mobs with a controlled test-only host effect_snapshot provision through the existing SDK; proves callback/state behavior, not actual player drinking, Java clients, visual particles, native sound rendering or full mob effect support.",
  "remaining_edges": [
    "Native hurt cooldown can invoke beforeHurt then suppress afterHurt. Same-tick provisional read before that rejection is known remains a source timing gap, even though rejected credit is not committed.",
    "Exact entity baseTick/death/disconnect ordering and unloaded-player effect access still need source/native/client work.",
    "Java damage tags NO_ANGER and NO_ANGER_FROM_WIND_CHARGE have no generic Bedrock source-tag getter; unknown addon actor classes require explicit review.",
    "Exact elbow force, yaw, ground/air velocity and cumulative native knockback remain unimplemented; no fixed impulse was substituted."
  ]
